      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Why cash loses value over time",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/1-dlaczego-gotowka-traci-warto.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Why cash loses value over time"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Inflation** is a steady rise in prices: from too much money, more expensive production and high demand."
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "Too much money in the economy",
                "Rising production costs",
                "High demand "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "space",
              "size": 16
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Over time the same amount buys you less. With 0% interest in your account and 3–5% inflation, you lose as much as inflation is."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tasks": [],
