    {
      "id": "l3",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "How compound interest works\n",
      "tasks": [],
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "How compound interest works"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-jak-dziala-procent-skladany.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Interest is added to your capital and **starts earning on its own**, so the capital grows exponentially like a snowball. Over time the interest earned exceeds the capital you paid in."
            },
            {
              "type": "divider"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This picture shows how the gains pile up compared with the money paid in."
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/procent-skladany-2.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 220,
              "caption": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Time as an advantage",
      "tasks": [],
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Time as an advantage"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/3-czas-jako-przewaga.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The earlier you start, the less you need to pay in for the same goal. A long horizon smooths out crashes, because over decades the market has historically grown."
            },
            {
              "type": "divider"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For example, paying in 200 € every month at 7% a year, with interest added monthly and reinvested."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "rows": [
                {
                  "cells": [
                    "Time (years)",
                    "Total paid in",
                    "You'll have",
                    "Interest"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    "5",
                    "12,000 €",
                    "14,300 €",
                    "2,300 €"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    "10",
                    "24,000 €",
                    "34,600 €",
                    "10,600 €"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    "15",
                    "36,000 €",
                    "63,400 €",
                    "27,400 €"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    "30",
                    "72,000 €",
                    "244,000 €",
                    "172,000 €"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "header": true,
              "style": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "After 30 years more than two thirds of the amount is interest, not your payments."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      }
    },
